[resource]
script = ExtResource("2_agye6")
letter_id = 430
description = "[font_size=48]Orange,

I found myself once more among the trees of a grove near identical to my own. In which timeline, I am unsure. The world there and then seemed to be at a standstill, no civilization having arose quite yet. Birdsong ruled the trees and the wild beasts called no man nor woman their master. I believe even the ocean sang of a spirit free from being bested by boats. The grove was full of sunlight, and warmth, and everything one might find perfect.

I have never felt so alone.

I sat and watched a sapling grow from my knees to my neck, studied the way its branches curled and spread. Its form mimicked none of what I thought it might turn into. Its shape was not bound by its youth nor the grove it called home.

The ash that cradled me as a child would be disappointed by my commitment to form. It seems, as always, my stubborn nature bettered me.

I admit I have longed for your embrace each day I watched that tree rise from the soil, and it brings me a joy to rival the warmth of that sun to see your writing once more.
"
letter_format = ExtResource("1_6j2ot")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://gbihjja6jybk"
